# 5. Heart Rate / IBI API

## 5.1 TrackerType

```kotlin
HealthTrackerType.HEART_RATE_CONTINUOUS
```

## 5.2 ValueKey Set

```kotlin
ValueKey.HeartRateSet
```

`ValueKey.HeartRateSet`은 `HEART_RATE_CONTINUOUS`를 위한 data set이다.

---

## 5.3 ValueKey 목록

| ValueKey | Type | 의미 | 단위 |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ValueKey.HeartRateSet.HEART_RATE` | `Integer` | Heart rate value | bpm |
| `ValueKey.HeartRateSet.HEART_RATE_STATUS` | `Integer` | Heart rate measurement status | status code |
| `ValueKey.HeartRateSet.IBI_LIST` | `List<Integer>` | Inter-beat interval list | ms |
| `ValueKey.HeartRateSet.IBI_STATUS_LIST` | `List<Integer>` | IBI measurement status list | status code |

공식 문서 기준 `HEART_RATE`는 bpm 단위의 심박수이고, `IBI_LIST`는 millisecond 단위의 inter-beat interval list이다.

---

## 5.4 Status Code

### `HEART_RATE_STATUS`

| Code | 의미 |
|---|---|
| `-999` | Higher priority sensor, such as BIA, is operating |
| `-10` | PPG signal is too weak or user movement is too large |
| `-8` | PPG signal is weak or user moved |
| `-3` | Wearable is detached |
| `-2` | Wearable movement is detected |
| `0` | Initial measuring state, or higher priority sensor is operating |
| `1` | Successful heart rate measurement |

### `IBI_STATUS_LIST`

| Code | 의미 |
|---|---|
| `-1` | Error |
| `0` | Normal |

---

## 5.5 저장 변수명

```kotlin
val timestamp: Long
val heartRate: Int
val heartRateStatus: Int
val ibiList: List<Int>
val ibiStatusList: List<Int>
```

---

## 5.6 권장 파일

```text
watch-app/sensor/HeartRateTrackerManager.kt
```

---

## 5.7 예제 코드

```kotlin
class HeartRateTrackerManager(
    private val healthTrackingService: HealthTrackingService,
    private val onSampleReceived: (
        sensorType: String,
        timestamp: Long,
        valueName: String,
        value: String,
        status: Int?
    ) -> Unit
) {

    private var heartRateTracker: HealthTracker? = null

    fun createTracker() {
        heartRateTracker = healthTrackingService.getHealthTracker(
            HealthTrackerType.HEART_RATE_CONTINUOUS
        )
    }

    fun startTracking() {
        heartRateTracker?.setEventListener(heartRateListener)
    }

    fun stopTracking() {
        heartRateTracker?.unsetEventListener()
    }

    private val heartRateListener = object : HealthTracker.TrackerEventListener {

        override fun onDataReceived(dataPoints: List<DataPoint>) {
            dataPoints.forEach { dataPoint ->

                val timestamp = dataPoint.timestamp

                val heartRate = dataPoint.getValue(
                    ValueKey.HeartRateSet.HEART_RATE
                )

                val heartRateStatus = dataPoint.getValue(
                    ValueKey.HeartRateSet.HEART_RATE_STATUS
                )

                val ibiList = dataPoint.getValue(
                    ValueKey.HeartRateSet.IBI_LIST
                )

                val ibiStatusList = dataPoint.getValue(
                    ValueKey.HeartRateSet.IBI_STATUS_LIST
                )

                onSampleReceived(
                    "HEART_RATE",
                    timestamp,
                    "heart_rate",
                    heartRate.toString(),
                    heartRateStatus
                )

                ibiList?.forEachIndexed { index, ibi ->
                    val ibiStatus = ibiStatusList?.getOrNull(index)

                    onSampleReceived(
                        "IBI",
                        timestamp,
                        "ibi_$index",
                        ibi.toString(),
                        ibiStatus
                    )
                }
            }
        }

        override fun onFlushCompleted() {
            Log.d("HeartRateTracker", "Flush completed")
        }

        override fun onError(error: HealthTracker.TrackerError) {
            Log.e("HeartRateTracker", "Error: $error")
        }
    }
}
```

