# 7. Accelerometer API

## 7.1 TrackerType

```kotlin
HealthTrackerType.ACCELEROMETER_CONTINUOUS
```

## 7.2 ValueKey Set

```kotlin
ValueKey.AccelerometerSet
```

`ValueKey.AccelerometerSet`은 `ACCELEROMETER_CONTINUOUS`용 data set이다.

---

## 7.3 ValueKey 목록

| ValueKey | Type | 의미 |
|---|---|---|
| `ValueKey.AccelerometerSet.ACCELEROMETER_X` | `Integer` | X-axis accelerometer raw data |
| `ValueKey.AccelerometerSet.ACCELEROMETER_Y` | `Integer` | Y-axis accelerometer raw data |
| `ValueKey.AccelerometerSet.ACCELEROMETER_Z` | `Integer` | Z-axis accelerometer raw data |

공식 문서 기준 Accelerometer 값은 gravity를 포함하지 않는 raw data이다.

---

## 7.4 단위 변환

공식 문서 기준 raw value는 아래 식으로 `m/s²`로 변환할 수 있다.

```text
m/s² = (9.81 / (16383.75 / 4.0)) * rawValue
```

---

## 7.5 저장 변수명

```kotlin
val timestamp: Long
val accX: Int
val accY: Int
val accZ: Int
```

변환값까지 저장할 경우:

```kotlin
val accXMps2: Float
val accYMps2: Float
val accZMps2: Float
```

---

## 7.6 권장 파일

```text
watch-app/sensor/AccelerometerTrackerManager.kt
```

---

## 7.7 예제 코드

```kotlin
class AccelerometerTrackerManager(
    private val healthTrackingService: HealthTrackingService,
    private val onSampleReceived: (
        sensorType: String,
        timestamp: Long,
        valueName: String,
        value: String,
        status: Int?
    ) -> Unit
) {

    private var accelerometerTracker: HealthTracker? = null

    fun createTracker() {
        accelerometerTracker = healthTrackingService.getHealthTracker(
            HealthTrackerType.ACCELEROMETER_CONTINUOUS
        )
    }

    fun startTracking() {
        accelerometerTracker?.setEventListener(accelerometerListener)
    }

    fun stopTracking() {
        accelerometerTracker?.unsetEventListener()
    }

    private fun convertRawToMps2(rawValue: Int): Float {
        return ((9.81f / (16383.75f / 4.0f)) * rawValue)
    }

    private val accelerometerListener = object : HealthTracker.TrackerEventListener {

        override fun onDataReceived(dataPoints: List<DataPoint>) {
            dataPoints.forEach { dataPoint ->

                val timestamp = dataPoint.timestamp

                val accX = dataPoint.getValue(
                    ValueKey.AccelerometerSet.ACCELEROMETER_X
                )

                val accY = dataPoint.getValue(
                    ValueKey.AccelerometerSet.ACCELEROMETER_Y
                )

                val accZ = dataPoint.getValue(
                    ValueKey.AccelerometerSet.ACCELEROMETER_Z
                )

                onSampleReceived(
                    "ACCELEROMETER",
                    timestamp,
                    "accelerometer_x_raw",
                    accX.toString(),
                    null
                )

                onSampleReceived(
                    "ACCELEROMETER",
                    timestamp,
                    "accelerometer_y_raw",
                    accY.toString(),
                    null
                )

                onSampleReceived(
                    "ACCELEROMETER",
                    timestamp,
                    "accelerometer_z_raw",
                    accZ.toString(),
                    null
                )

                onSampleReceived(
                    "ACCELEROMETER",
                    timestamp,
                    "accelerometer_x_mps2",
                    convertRawToMps2(accX).toString(),
                    null
                )

                onSampleReceived(
                    "ACCELEROMETER",
                    timestamp,
                    "accelerometer_y_mps2",
                    convertRawToMps2(accY).toString(),
                    null
                )

                onSampleReceived(
                    "ACCELEROMETER",
                    timestamp,
                    "accelerometer_z_mps2",
                    convertRawToMps2(accZ).toString(),
                    null
                )
            }
        }

        override fun onFlushCompleted() {
            Log.d("AccelerometerTracker", "Flush completed")
        }

        override fun onError(error: HealthTracker.TrackerError) {
            Log.e("AccelerometerTracker", "Error: $error")
        }
    }
}
```

